<title>UK: BRITAIN-NATWEST-SFO.</title>
<headline>BRITAIN-NATWEST-SFO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Serious Fraud Office (SFO), which investigates and prosecutes major financial fraud, confirmed on Friday it was keeping abreast of developments relating to NatWest Market's options losses.</p>
<p>&quot;NatWest Group has been in touch with us concerning the review of NatWest Market's interest rate options trading. We have not begun an investigation but we are monitoring the situation,&quot; an SFO spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
